OL,3,GNEWSANo explosive devices found after
OL,4,Acar bomb scare
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo explosive devices were found
OL,7,Ffollowing a bomb scare involving a
OL,8,Fparked car in a residential street.
OL,10,FHomes were evacuated in Sherwood
OL,11,FAvenue, Poole, on Friday evening amid
OL,12,Freports the car contained an explosive
OL,13,Fdevice.
OL,15,FDorset Police said an Explosive
OL,16,FOrdnance Disposal (EOD) team was called
OL,17,Fbut, after making the scene safe,
OL,18,Festablished it was not a viable
OL,19,Fexplosive device and did not pose a
OL,20,Frisk to the public.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
