OL,3,GNEWSANo explosive devices found after
OL,4,Acar bomb scare
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said officers also searched a
OL,7,Fproperty in Park Homer Drive in
OL,8,FColehill, near Wimborne, and found no
OL,9,Fexplosive devices. No arrests were made
OL,10,Fand investigations continue.
